WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.048 --> 00:00:04.819
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:07.498
What do they see?

3
00:00:07.499 --> 00:00:18.821
They see a baseball field.

4
00:00:18.822 --> 00:00:32.719
The blobs are ready to play.

5
00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:51.254
They throw baseballs.

6
00:00:51.255 --> 00:01:12.585
They swing bats.

7
00:01:12.586 --> 00:01:27.993
They hit baseballs with bats.

8
00:01:27.994 --> 00:01:45.075
They run around the bases.

9
00:01:45.076 --> 00:01:56.949
They tag each other with baseballs.

10
00:01:56.950 --> 00:02:17.960
They get home runs!

11
00:02:17.961 --> 00:02:22.956
Good game, blobs!

12
00:02:22.957 --> 00:02:26.919
Silly blobs.

13
00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:29.938
Good-bye!

